---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Pacing is a decision about time" currentPath="/manifesto/foundations/pacing">

  <article class="principle-document">
    <header class="principle-header">
      <div class="principle-meta">
        <span>I.3</span>
        <span>E01-P04</span>
      </div>
      <h1>Pacing is a decision about time</h1>
      <p class="abstract">Pacing determines how understanding forms by controlling when information is revealed.</p>
    </header>

    <section class="principle-content">
      <h2>Statement</h2>
      <p>Pacing is not a performance choice.</p>
      <p>It is a structural decision about time.</p>

      <h2>Context</h2>
      <p>Systems often confuse pacing with urgency — using speed to create pressure. But pacing is about cognitive rhythm: the rate at which information can be absorbed without overwhelming the user's capacity to process it.</p>
      <p>Deliberate deceleration is not inefficiency. It is respect for how understanding actually forms.</p>

      <h2>Application</h2>
      <p>Pacing manifests through consistent intervals. Content unfolds at a predictable rate — never accelerating to create drama, never stalling to withhold. Each page operates at the same cognitive speed, allowing users to traverse depth rather than breadth.</p>

      <h2>Citation</h2>
      <p class="citation-text">This principle may be cited as: <strong>I.3 (Pacing)</strong> or by plate reference <strong>E01-P04</strong>.</p>
    </section>
  </article>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .principle-document {
    max-width: 700px;
  }

  .principle-header {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(42, 42, 37, 0.15);
  }

  .principle-meta {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-nav);
    font-size: 0.55rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    opacity: 0.45;
  }

  .principle-header h1 {
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .abstract {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    font-style: italic;
    opacity: 0.75;
  }

  .principle-content h2 {
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    font-family: var(--font-nav);
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
